*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for SAP. Only here are keywords of RoboSAPiens used.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/sap_ability.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Connect To Sap Client
    [Documentation]    Connects to an SAP GUI that is already open and logged in.
    Connect To Running SAP

Run Transaction Code
    [Documentation]    Starts a transaction by its code, e.g. "SU3".
    [Arguments]    ${code}
    Execute Transaction    ${code}

Read Sap Window Title
    [Documentation]    Reads the title of the active SAP window and returns it.
    ${title}    Get Window Title
    RETURN    ${title}

Close Sap Client
    [Documentation]    Closes SAP.
    Close SAP
